    {
      "id": "V36",
      "desc": "unpaired surrogate in a canonical string field \u2014 malformed input rejected before evaluation; no decision, no evidence record. (The JSON escape below decodes to a lone surrogate in parsers that accept it; a parser that refuses to decode the input has also conformed.)",
